---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About GreenGuard USA | Austin Mosquito Control"
  description="GreenGuard USA brings CO₂ trap technology to Austin homeowners. Pesticide-free, founded in 2025, all-electric fleet."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-bg-card via-bg to-accent-deep/40 py-16 px-5 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-2">About</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
        Built on a <span class="text-accent">simple conviction</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-cream/80 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Mosquito control should target mosquitoes, and nothing else.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDER STORY -->
  <section class="py-16 px-5">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Why GreenGuard USA Exists</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white mb-6">Why <span class="text-accent">GreenGuard USA</span> exists</h2>

      <figure class="mb-8">
        <img
          src="/images/founderPhoto.jpg"
          alt="Lauren Hughes, founder of GreenGuard USA"
          loading="lazy"
          class="w-full rounded-xl border border-accent/15 shadow-lg"
        />
        <figcaption class="text-cream/55 text-xs text-center mt-2 italic">Lauren Hughes, founder</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-cream/85 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Lauren Hughes founded GreenGuard USA in 2025 after years of watching families across Austin
          fight a losing battle against mosquitoes, including her own. Over 25 years in Central Texas
          raising two kids and a dog, she watched summer evenings get harder to enjoy. Mosquitoes took
          over, and being outside after sunset meant constantly getting swarmed.
        </p>
        <p>
          What Lauren noticed was not just more mosquitoes, but fewer of the things families actually
          want around their homes. Bees, butterflies, and fireflies became harder to find. Neighbors
          were spraying more pesticides, but the mosquitoes kept coming back while pollinators disappeared.
        </p>
        <p>
          That search led her to CO₂ mosquito trapping, a system that mimics human breath to specifically
          attract and capture mosquitoes without pesticides, without toxic residue, and without harming
          pollinators or beneficial insects. For the first time, she found something that actually worked
          while protecting the environment instead of damaging it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="py-16 px-5 bg-bg-panel">
    <div class="max-w-container mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Core Values</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white">What We Stand For</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3"></div>
          <div class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Ecosystem stewardship</div>
          <p class="text-cream/70 text-sm">We target only blood-seeking insects. Bees, butterflies, and pollinators are untouched.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3"></div>
          <div class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Honest science</div>
          <p class="text-cream/70 text-sm">Peer-reviewed equipment, transparent efficacy data, no marketing fluff.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3"></div>
          <div class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Clean operations</div>
          <p class="text-cream/70 text-sm">Zero-emission EV fleet across the Austin metro.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3"></div>
          <div class="text-white font-bold mb-2">No-pressure service</div>
          <p class="text-cream/70 text-sm">Month-to-month. No contracts, no upsells, no pressure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 px-5 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-white mb-4">Meet the team in person</h2>
      <p class="text-cream/75 mb-6">Free property assessment. Bring your questions.</p>
      <a href="/book" class="btn-gold">Book Free Assessment</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
